			"notes": "## English\n\n### Changes\n- Refactored smart pattern multiplication into request, queue, scheduler, and persistence components.\n- Unified counted input admission and updated Data Energistics, Neo ECO AE, and OmniSequence compatibility.\n- Updated Data Energistics to CurseMaven file 8841396 and OmniSequence to file 8622739.\n\n### Fixes\n- Reduced idle smart-multiplication overhead with backoff and wake-up handling.\n- Prevented duplicate counted-CPU multiplication and incorrect input ownership transfer.\n- Added safer validation for complete counted inputs, multipliers, and arithmetic overflow.\n\n## 中文\n\n### 变更\n- 重构智能样板倍增，拆分请求、队列、调度器和持久化组件。\n- 统一计数型输入 admission，并更新 Data Energistics、Neo ECO AE 与 OmniSequence 兼容。\n- Data Energistics 更新至 CurseMaven 文件 8841396，OmniSequence 更新至文件 8622739。\n\n### 修复\n- 通过退避和唤醒机制降低智能倍增空闲处理开销。\n- 修复计数型 CPU 重复倍增和失败提交时错误转移输入所有权的问题。\n- 增强完整计数输入、倍率和算术溢出的安全校验。\n\nAE2 Lightning Tech and Thunderbolt compatibility remain unchanged."
